<title>USA: Omaha hogs up firm/up $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up firm/up $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were firm to $0.25</p>
<p>higher. Top $61.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    61.50-61.75</p>
<p>Sows: Narrowly tested, steady. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
